---
// One-page "About" section — replaces the standalone /about page.
// Elliott's founder note plus a short Mac blurb.
---

<section id="about" class="about-section section">
  <p class="section-label">Who you're working with</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">The team behind Unleashing Flow</h2>

  <div class="note-block">
    <p class="note-para">
      I spent twenty years running operations inside organizations much bigger than most — the Pentagon, Morgan Stanley, healthcare, pharma, a telehealth division I built from scratch. I'm doing this work now for one reason: the same operational problems show up at every scale, but the leaks are visible, the fixes pay back faster, and the decision-maker is in the room when the call gets made.
    </p>
    <p class="note-para">
      Most of what's costing your business money isn't visible until someone looks carefully. That's the work. We find it, quantify it, and use AI as the leverage that lets a small senior team deliver what used to require a full-time hire.
    </p>
    <cite class="note-cite">
      <strong>Elliott English</strong>
      <span>Co-Founder, Unleashing Flow</span>
    </cite>
  </div>

  <div class="partner-block">
    <p class="partner-para">
      <strong>Mac Steele</strong> has spent his career taking proven technology into industries that had never used it — from proxy tabulation for institutional investors, to RFID inventory control, to fifteen years pushing established manufacturing technology from brick into metals, mining, and steel. The job was the same every time: find a company's real problem, match it to technology that solves it, and help them pull value out of it.
    </p>
    <p class="partner-para partner-role">
      Mac leads business development and partnerships — he finds the businesses with the right problems. Elliott builds the solutions.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-section .section-desc {
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .note-block {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 32px auto 0;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #E8E0D6;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 48px 44px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .note-para {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--charcoal);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .note-cite {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    font-style: normal;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .note-cite strong {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--charcoal);
  }

  .note-cite span {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--warm-gray);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .partner-block {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 24px auto 0;
    text-align: left;
    padding: 0 12px;
  }

  .partner-para {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--charcoal);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .partner-para strong {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .partner-role {
    color: var(--warm-gray);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .note-block {
      padding: 32px 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
